    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We got attacked, and the fighting spread over here. Ines, one of the mercenary team leaders, is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not going to identify the body?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...The fighting was pretty noisy. It's drawing a lot of attention. Blow the whole street, now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion also needs people... who fight like her until the very end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care of my family. They're still back in town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Soldier"
    },
